transmission (4.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  [ Pino Toscano ]
  * Drop menu files and their Debian-specific pixmaps, since transmission-gtk
    & transmission-qt already provide .desktop files
    - drop the lintian overrides related to them
  * Ship the application pixmap in transmission-common.
  * Copy the man pages using dh_install rather than dh_installmanpages, as they
    are installed in the right location already by the upstream build system.
  * Ship the AppStream metadata for transmission-gtk.

  [ Debian Janitor ]
  * Remove constraints unnecessary since buster:
    + Build-Depends: Drop versioned constraint on libevent-dev,
      libminiupnpc-dev, libnatpmp-dev and libnotify-dev.
    + transmission-common: Drop versioned constraint on transmission-gtk in
      Replaces.
    + transmission-common: Drop versioned constraint on transmission-gtk in
      Breaks.
    + transmission-cli: Drop versioned constraint on transmission-daemon in
      Replaces.
    + transmission-cli: Drop versioned constraint on transmission-daemon in
      Breaks.
    + transmission-daemon: Drop versioned constraint on lsb-base in Depends.
    + transmission-daemon: Drop versioned constraint on transmission-cli in
      Recommends.
    + transmission-daemon: Drop versioned constraint on transmission-cli in
      Replaces.
    + transmission-daemon: Drop versioned constraint on transmission-cli in
      Breaks.

  [ Leo Antunes ]
  * [4ce635f3] fix(watch): update github path
  * [af4837c8] New upstream version 4.0.0
  * [a8cce533] feat(rules): update for cmake
  * [c9cfb739] chore: drop out-of-date patches
  * [12303dea] chore: bump dh to 13
  * [00fa1274] fix: update build-deps
  * [d01ed004] fix: update rules to (re)enable features
  * [9535e0b8] chore: drop upstart file
  * [ce61a090] fix: update paths for newer debhelper
  * [e674fa04] chore: add lintian-overrides for missing js source
  * [603daf61] chore: update debian/copyright
  * [9bda2fcb] chore: remove preinst fix for long EOL version

  [ Barak A. Pearlmutter ]
  * New upstream release; Closes: #1030857
  * Trim trailing whitespace.
  * Set upstream metadata fields: Bug-Database.
  * Remove listed license files (third-party/libb64/LICENSE, web/LICENSE) from
    copyright.
  * Fix day-of-week for changelog entries 2.33-1, 1.40-5.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.6.2
  * Rules-Requires-Root: no
  * Generate library package libtransmission
  * Set up doc dir links using dh_installdocs --link-doc=transmission-common and
    change packages transmission and transmisison-common from arch:all to
    arch: any in order to allow documentation symbolic links.
  * Daemon should suggest external remote client transmission-remote-gtk
  * Generate libtransmission-dev static library package
  * Remove dependency on obsolete package lsb-base
  * Remove obsolete .menu files
  * Harden
  * Remove old debian/NEWS
  * Add missing Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
  * Avoid duplication of email script
  * Remove obsolete (now incorrect) transmission-common README.debian file

 -- Leo Antunes <costela@debian.org>  Sat, 04 Mar 2023 23:12:23 +0100

